                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Pan American Airways, Inc./498:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Culbertson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-06-22T12:00:00-05:00">June 22,
                        1929—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 12:50 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>96. Your 65, June 19, 7 p.m. Decree signed granting concession to Pan
                    American-Grace Airways.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Clubertson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
